OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fgradually fade this evening. Cloud
OL,7,Fwill increase overnight, with rain
OL,8,Farriving in the west, turning heavy in
OL,9,Fthe north by morning. Winds also
OL,10,Fincreasing towards dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA rather cloudy, breezy,
OL,13,Fand wet day, with the rain heaviest
OL,14,Fand most persistent towards the north.
OL,15,FTemperatures near average, but feeling
OL,16,Frather cool in prolonged spells of
OL,17,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
